 References
 
  - Ground-state CCD/CC2/CCSD/CCSD(T) energies, CCD/CCSD expectation values:
     JV Pototschnig et al., J. Chem. Theory Comput. 17, 5509 (2021).
     doi: 10.1021/acs.jctc.1c00260
 
  - MP2 virtual frozen natural orbitals, generation of CC natural orbitals:
     X Yuan, L Visscher, ASP Gomes, J. Chem. Phys. 156, 224108 (2022). 
     doi: 10.1063/5.0087243
 
  - Equation of motion coupled cluster (EOM-CCSD) for IP, EE and EA:
     X Yuan, PhD thesis, Vrije Universiteit Amsterdam and Universite de Lille
     doi: 10.5463/thesis.505
 
  - EOM-CCSD 1RDMs and CCSD 2RDM
     L Halbert, ASP Gomes, in preparation (2024)
 
  - CI-singles (CIS) excitation energies and transition moments
     X Yuan, ASP Gomes, in preparation (2024)
 
  - Orbital-unrelaxed linear response EOM-(EE-)CCSD and CCSD theory:
     X Yuan et al., J. Chem. Theory Comput. (2024). 
     doi: 10.1021/acs.jctc.3c00812
 
  - Orbital-unrelaxed quadratic response EOM-(EE-)CCSD theory:
     X Yuan, L Halbert, L Visscher, ASP Gomes, J. Chem. Theory Comput. 19, 9248 (2023). 
     doi: 10.1021/acs.jctc.3c01011
 
  - Higher-order coupled cluster methods
